must reach :sink before the continuous-flow rule releases its eymsg:nextEnvelope. Observation payloads are inspected with log:includes inside their own message formula, and the delimiter-only third message is replayed as an empty heartbeat. This keeps message boundaries in the parser/runtime instead of modeling them by hand in the TriG sidecar." . }.

